    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/3fcf80c9091c8a00e62193935ae5374e.avif?t=1754836454\" width=548 height=200 /></span><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/99c06310aab76a56785450da9445016a.poster.avif?t=1754836454\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/99c06310aab76a56785450da9445016a.webm?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/99c06310aab76a56785450da9445016a.mp4?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Create Your Own Party!</strong><br><br>Combine numerous characters and cards to create your own party.<br>You can freely mix and match them to create the optimal team, <br>and the tactics and play style of your party will be determined by your choices.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/2ca81ab9d5a408c91f2e80926bac7180.poster.avif?t=1754836454\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/2ca81ab9d5a408c91f2e80926bac7180.webm?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/2ca81ab9d5a408c91f2e80926bac7180.mp4?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore Dungeons and Defeat Enemies with Cards!</strong><br><br>In dungeons, various enemies await you. Utilize cards efficiently to defeat them.<br>Strategic abilities and card combinations will determine victory or defeat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/725b14d123b55618d3d62bedd589a16c.poster.avif?t=1754836454\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/725b14d123b55618d3d62bedd589a16c.webm?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/725b14d123b55618d3d62bedd589a16c.mp4?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Enhance Characters and Cards!</strong><br><br>Use rewards obtained from exploring various dungeons to enhance your characters.<br>Improve stats and reinforce cards to develop your unique battle style and prepare for various combat situations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/20a2dedbaedf40706fbe2f7629bf6168.poster.avif?t=1754836454\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/20a2dedbaedf40706fbe2f7629bf6168.webm?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/20a2dedbaedf40706fbe2f7629bf6168.mp4?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>- Various character skins<br>- Over 100 characters<br>- Over 1000 cards<br>- Continuous updates",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/3fcf80c9091c8a00e62193935ae5374e.avif?t=1754836454\" width=548 height=200 /></span><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/99c06310aab76a56785450da9445016a.poster.avif?t=1754836454\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/99c06310aab76a56785450da9445016a.webm?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/99c06310aab76a56785450da9445016a.mp4?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Create Your Own Party!</strong><br><br>Combine numerous characters and cards to create your own party.<br>You can freely mix and match them to create the optimal team, <br>and the tactics and play style of your party will be determined by your choices.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/2ca81ab9d5a408c91f2e80926bac7180.poster.avif?t=1754836454\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/2ca81ab9d5a408c91f2e80926bac7180.webm?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/2ca81ab9d5a408c91f2e80926bac7180.mp4?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore Dungeons and Defeat Enemies with Cards!</strong><br><br>In dungeons, various enemies await you. Utilize cards efficiently to defeat them.<br>Strategic abilities and card combinations will determine victory or defeat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/725b14d123b55618d3d62bedd589a16c.poster.avif?t=1754836454\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/725b14d123b55618d3d62bedd589a16c.webm?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/725b14d123b55618d3d62bedd589a16c.mp4?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Enhance Characters and Cards!</strong><br><br>Use rewards obtained from exploring various dungeons to enhance your characters.<br>Improve stats and reinforce cards to develop your unique battle style and prepare for various combat situations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/20a2dedbaedf40706fbe2f7629bf6168.poster.avif?t=1754836454\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/20a2dedbaedf40706fbe2f7629bf6168.webm?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750920/extras/20a2dedbaedf40706fbe2f7629bf6168.mp4?t=1754836454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>- Various character skins<br>- Over 100 characters<br>- Over 1000 cards<br>- Continuous updates",
